# Chest X-Ray AI Pipeline — Cursor Rules

## Project Overview
This is a medical imaging AI pipeline for chest X-ray disease detection.
It uses ConvNeXt-Tiny pretrained on ImageNet-22K to classify thoracic conditions
from the NIH ChestX-ray14 dataset (112,120 images, 14 conditions).

The project is being built as a commercial diagnostic AI product targeting
private clinics in Tijuana, Mexico. The long-term vision is a full diagnostic
platform for Latin America starting with chest X-ray screening.

