## File Structure
- config.py     — all hyperparameters and paths. Change CONDITION here to switch diseases.
- utils.py      — seed setting, worker init, directory helpers
- dataset.py    — ChestXrayDataset class, transforms, data loading, train/val/test splits
- model.py      — ConvNeXt-Tiny, BCEWithLogitsLoss with pos_weight, AdamW, ReduceLROnPlateau
- train.py      — main training loop with checkpoint save/resume
- evaluate.py   — test set evaluation with AUC, sensitivity, specificity, threshold analysis
- inference.py  — single image prediction with clinical disclaimer
- scan.py       — scans dataset for corrupted PNG files

