## Data
- Dataset: NIH ChestX-ray14
- Images: 112,120 PNG files at data/images/images/
- Labels: data/Data_Entry_2017_v2020.csv
- Official splits: data/train_val_list.txt and data/test_list.txt
- Train: 77,871 | Val: 8,653 | Test: 25,596
- Images are 1024x1024 originally, resized to IMG_SIZE (default 224) during loading

